WEBVTT

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:36.710
My dear Katakura,

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:41.290
I want you to join us.

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:45.340
What?

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:50.600
I've heard of your exploits, my dear Katakura.

00:01:50.690 --> 00:01:52.810
You mimicked the Tiger of Kai's own strategy

00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:56.020
to outmaneuver Takeda himself.

00:01:56.110 --> 00:01:57.850
You were capable of leading the great force

00:01:57.950 --> 00:02:02.110
that was composed of all the eastern
armies gathered to bring down Oda.

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:05.530
At Honnoji, you sent Akechi
Mitsuhide to meet his maker,

00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:09.610
allowing your lord to fight the Devil King.

00:02:09.710 --> 00:02:13.040
Without you, Azuchi Castle
probably would not have fallen.

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:16.630
And this most recent affair at Kawanakajima.

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:20.050
In my own way, I had spent much
time planning out that operation.

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:24.130
But you ruined it for me in an
instant with your quick thinking.

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:28.060
I have never suffered such a
blow at the hands of anyone else.

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:32.690
Why didn't you raise your own army?

00:02:32.770 --> 00:02:34.760
You should have been able to do it.

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:37.190
An even more powerful, more disciplined...

00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:41.520
Yes, a splendid army like Toyotomi's.

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:43.530
It would be unthinkable for
anyone but Lord Masamune

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:46.400
to be Number One of the Date Army of Oshu.

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:49.610
I'm here as his Right Eye. That's all!

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:53.240
Only when you come work
for Hideyoshi will your talents

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:55.420
surely be put to truly good use.

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:56.080
And...

00:02:56.130 --> 00:02:58.590
I've had about enough of that.

00:02:58.670 --> 00:03:00.630
It's unbecoming for a man to use flattery.

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:03.460
You can use it all you
want, I won't turn traitor.

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:05.890
I was giving you a legitimate assessment.

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:11.180
You have too much to offer
to be crushed in the fall of Date.

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:13.810
I, Katakura Kojuro,

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:20.850
have no intention of ever serving
anyone other than Lord Masamune!

00:03:22.030 --> 00:03:24.990
I didn't come here so we could kill each other.

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:28.440
However, depending on your answer...

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:30.320
M-Master Katakura...

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:34.330
Your methods are no different
from that of common bandits.

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:39.460
It shows how shallow you are for all
your pompous talk, Takenaka Hanbei!

00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:40.710
That hurts.

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:45.130
It shows just how much
we want for you to join us.

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:48.010
You don't understand the way of the Date!

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:50.340
I believe I do know.

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:52.720
The lives of nameless people living on the land

00:03:52.810 --> 00:03:56.020
and your loyalty to your lord,
the dear boy Masamune...

00:03:56.110 --> 00:03:59.940
You would naively try to protect them both...

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:05.020
In other words, it means there is
no way for you to win in this situation.

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:49.900
Master Katakura!

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:04.130
Y-You bastard...

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:10.970
Do you think me underhanded, my dear Katakura?

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:18.390
When there is no time, people
behave disgracefully in their haste...

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:22.770
Number One! Number One!

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:23.890
Th-Th-Th-There's trouble, Number One!

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:26.150
What is it?

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:28.950
Have you found the spying bastard
from Toyotomi's camp or something?

00:05:29.030 --> 00:05:30.610
W-We're under attack!

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:34.320
Nabu, Tsugaru, and Souma!
From all three fronts at the same time!

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:36.200
Eh?

00:05:43.170 --> 00:05:46.380
Shit! So they've come already.

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:49.670
You've sent someone to notify Kojuro, too?

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:52.720
Yes, Sir. Bunshichiro has
gone to let Master Katakura...

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:54.550
Number One!

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:56.930
M-Master Katakura's been...!

00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:04.770
O-Suzu from the village and her
grandaddy came running to my place!

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:07.100
They said someone had gotten Master Katakura!

00:06:09.070 --> 00:06:10.860
What?!

00:06:12.370 --> 00:06:15.280
We found this in the field on the hill...

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:17.280
That's Master Katakura's...

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:19.160
The Kokuryu!

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:36.090
It seems he was attacked by
a group of men late at night.

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:39.800
Using dirty tricks, they took
Master Katakura away somewhere...

00:06:39.900 --> 00:06:42.350
We found out who the traitor was, too.

00:06:44.020 --> 00:06:46.310
Who was the ringleader of this band?

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:48.360
Did he reveal his identity?

00:06:49.150 --> 00:06:50.940
It seems it was the Toyotomi's...

00:06:51.030 --> 00:06:53.490
...Takenaka Hanbei...

00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:57.990
Send scouts to Osaka.

00:06:58.080 --> 00:07:00.450
Once we reunify Oshu, we'll
immediately go to get him back.

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:01.700
Yes, Sir!

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:05.710
Don't just sit there. We're going to war!

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:08.410
Y-Yes, Sir!

00:07:08.510 --> 00:07:12.470
Good courage. Make a fool of me, will he?

00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:17.590
Looks like it's going to be a rough party.

00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:29.600
I guess you can do anything, huh, Kasuga?

00:07:29.690 --> 00:07:31.030
Of course.

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:34.650
As a ninja, one must be
proficient in all manner of things.

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:37.870
Especially this miso soup...

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:39.530
And these pickled vegetables.

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:41.610
Perfection!

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:45.120
Well, you're no match for Matsu, though.

00:07:45.210 --> 00:07:47.670
No, I imagine not.

00:07:49.460 --> 00:07:52.330
For all the praise, you have not eaten much.

00:07:52.430 --> 00:07:54.840
What? You think so?

00:07:54.930 --> 00:07:57.260
As Keiji says,

00:07:57.350 --> 00:08:01.810
it is so delicious, one almost
feels one should not eat it.

00:08:01.890 --> 00:08:03.600
Lord Kenshin...

00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:14.610
The divine protection of Bishamonten

00:08:14.700 --> 00:08:17.740
and your thoughtfully prepared morning meals...

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:20.910
No, not just your morning meals,
but evening meals as well,

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:24.450
and the tea we enjoy
together early in the afternoon...

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:26.700
I am a fortunate man.

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:30.580
L-Lord Kenshin, I am not
deserving of such words.

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:37.920
My beautiful blade, please
continue to grant me this supreme bliss.

00:08:38.010 --> 00:08:39.800
Y-Yes, my lord.

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:56.940
Why is it?

00:08:57.030 --> 00:09:00.270
W-Well, when you pose the question so formally,

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:02.200
I have no answer for you...

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:04.200
Why do you suppose it is?

00:09:04.290 --> 00:09:06.500
M-Mercy, Maeda Keiji.

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:09.580
You may be a vagabond, but you
must know a warrior's compassion...

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:13.710
Why can't everyone live like that?

00:09:15.550 --> 00:09:18.210
Like take even Toshi and Matsu.

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:24.090
They can finally live a life
free of the Devil King of Owari,

00:09:24.180 --> 00:09:28.050
and they both hate war, and yet...

00:09:29.860 --> 00:09:33.100
A tranquil and harmonious
land of the rising sun...

00:09:33.190 --> 00:09:35.100
Maeda Keiji...

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:36.150
Kasuga.

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:37.270
Yes, Sir?

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:39.100
Bring the sake.

00:09:42.450 --> 00:09:46.120
Toyotomi Hideyoshi...

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:48.490
He is menacing in a way that differs

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:51.790
from the Devil King of the
Sixth Heaven's ominous aura.

00:09:51.880 --> 00:09:53.660
And...

00:09:57.050 --> 00:09:58.710
Even Mori's cunning scheme

00:09:58.800 --> 00:10:02.390
to induce Oda to attack Kyushu
before the Inland Sea of Seto...

00:10:02.470 --> 00:10:08.010
Ultimately, one could say that, too,
was in the palm of Toyotomi's hand.

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:11.270
Toyotomi's strategist, Takenaka Hanbei,

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:14.720
may be a cut above even Mori Motonari,

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:17.360
who is renowned as a rare strategist.

00:10:17.450 --> 00:10:19.730
Mori's a smart general.

00:10:19.820 --> 00:10:21.650
Regardless of how he really feels,

00:10:21.740 --> 00:10:24.230
I think he'll align himself
with Toyotomi for the time being.

00:10:24.330 --> 00:10:27.320
Nothing could be more grave
than an alliance between those two.

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:30.280
In one fell swoop, power
will shift in Toyotomi's favor.

00:10:31.500 --> 00:10:35.040
Once that has come about,
the first to be targeted...

00:10:35.130 --> 00:10:38.210
...will be the land of Shikoku on the
other side of the Inland Sea of Seto.

00:10:45.270 --> 00:10:48.510
Ogre of the Western Sea, the truth is,
I have a big favor to ask of you.

00:10:48.600 --> 00:10:49.390
I'll do it.

00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:50.300
What?

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:52.850
I know what you're here for.

00:10:52.940 --> 00:10:55.680
You're putting together a huge
force to surround Oda of Owari

00:10:55.780 --> 00:10:59.770
and you want me to be part of it, right?

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:02.150
I'll prepare for whatever fate comes, too.

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:05.200
Give it your best shot, Keiji.

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:06.870
Motochika...

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:10.700
Chosokabe Motochika, head of Shikoku...

00:11:10.790 --> 00:11:13.620
When you proposed that he present
a united front with you against Oda,

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:16.500
you formed a bond of
friendship with him, did you not?

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:18.370
Yeah.

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:24.170
I've never met a more open and generous guy.

00:11:25.430 --> 00:11:29.550
Your old friend and your new
friend at each other's throats...

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:32.300
That must be hard to bear.

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:39.640
One of our men sent word just now.

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:44.070
I see.

00:11:46.030 --> 00:11:47.950
Where are you going, Keiji?

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:50.280
I think I'll meet with Hideyoshi, after all.

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:53.110
I'll make him stop the war on Motochika.

00:11:53.210 --> 00:11:54.450
Do not do this.

00:11:54.540 --> 00:11:56.920
I can't just leave things as they are.

00:11:57.000 --> 00:12:01.750
It is unlikely that Toyotomi
Hideyoshi will see you.

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:04.750
Why? How can you know that?

00:12:04.840 --> 00:12:08.630
Because I know the person you are right now.

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:13.010
However, put Echigo behind
you as quickly as you can.

00:12:13.100 --> 00:12:14.930
What is this about?

00:12:17.190 --> 00:12:18.050
Kenshin?

00:12:18.150 --> 00:12:20.270
Because the Maeda Army...

00:12:20.360 --> 00:12:22.980
...is closing in on Echigo.

00:12:23.070 --> 00:12:24.650
Huh?

00:12:24.740 --> 00:12:28.030
We will have to fight your family.

00:12:28.120 --> 00:12:29.530
What?!

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:31.230
We have no choice.

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:33.700
Lord Toshiie's resolve is firm.

00:12:33.790 --> 00:12:38.200
Whomever Heaven favors
will come out victorious.

00:12:45.340 --> 00:12:47.830
Targeted by Toyotomi's clandestine invasion,

00:12:47.930 --> 00:12:50.840
Date's territory of Oshu
faced attacks from three fronts:

00:12:50.930 --> 00:12:55.350
Nanbu, Tsugari, and Souma.

00:12:55.440 --> 00:12:59.430
On response, Date Masamune
divided his own forces evenly

00:12:59.520 --> 00:13:01.690
to pit against them.

00:13:06.910 --> 00:13:09.990
The battles were going in Date's favor,

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:15.870
but a force was on the march
from Aizu that would turn the tide.

00:13:23.840 --> 00:13:25.630
Number One!

00:13:25.720 --> 00:13:27.580
Our scouts have reported back.

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:31.090
The Ashina Army is apparently
closing in on us from Aizu!

00:13:31.180 --> 00:13:33.470
They're about to approach Suriagehara.

00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:35.170
How are the others doing?

00:13:35.270 --> 00:13:37.930
All fronts seem to be on the offensive for now,

00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:40.680
but we'll need to assign
troops against these guys, too...

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:03.990
Takenaka Hanbei, you've saved
me the trouble of coming after you.

00:14:04.090 --> 00:14:09.580
It was a mistake to divide up your
army equally, my dear Masamune.

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:11.540
What?

00:14:11.640 --> 00:14:14.880
If it were the dear boy Katakura,

00:14:14.970 --> 00:14:17.430
he would have sent the smallest forces possible

00:14:17.520 --> 00:14:21.560
to Nanbu, Tsugaru, and Souma
and fought evenly matched battles,

00:14:21.650 --> 00:14:25.560
or drawn them in as close as he
could before dealing with them.

00:14:25.650 --> 00:14:27.640
Because he would have
been wary that it was a feint

00:14:27.740 --> 00:14:30.570
to make it easier for
another detachment to invade.

00:14:50.260 --> 00:14:52.050
Be right there!

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:54.730
Normally, that back of yours would
be protected by the dear boy Katakura...

00:15:54.820 --> 00:15:56.490
It's so easy to slash apart now.

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:58.530
Bastard...

00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:01.530
I promise that he will be treated cordially.

00:16:01.620 --> 00:16:07.120
So rest easy and die a
noble death here at Suriagehara.

00:16:07.210 --> 00:16:12.210
That's just perfect! I'll pay you
back for that right here, right now!

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:14.090
War Dance!

00:16:25.100 --> 00:16:27.220
Perhaps I underestimated him a little...

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:41.240
Damn it!

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:58.510
So, they've... broken through...

00:16:59.470 --> 00:17:01.880
This is totally not cool.

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:08.680
The moment I'm robbed of my
Right Eye, this is the mess I get into...

00:17:08.770 --> 00:17:11.480
Even I have to admit it disgusts me!

00:17:18.830 --> 00:17:21.940
Come on! It's not over yet!

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:39.880
My lord, I, Sanada Yukimura,
am here to take my leave!

00:17:39.970 --> 00:17:42.460
Good. Mind yourself around water.

00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:44.170
I will, Sir!

00:17:44.270 --> 00:17:47.130
We have received word from
one of my men in the Ninja Corps.

00:17:47.230 --> 00:17:48.730
There is some trouble in Oshu.

00:17:48.810 --> 00:17:51.600
It appears Date has entered into
hostilities against neighboring lands,

00:17:51.690 --> 00:17:53.980
which were once under their control.

00:17:54.070 --> 00:17:57.310
Katakura Kojuro, the Right
Eye of the Dragon, is missing.

00:17:57.410 --> 00:17:59.610
What?! Master Katakura is?!

00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:03.780
Date Masamune, the One-Eyed Dragon,

00:18:03.870 --> 00:18:06.490
is currently fighting Ashina at Suriagehara.

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:09.070
As of last night, the battle...

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:11.530
...was not in Date's favor.

00:18:11.630 --> 00:18:14.330
With the Toyotomi setting their plot in motion,

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:19.040
the Date must be at an even greater
disadvantage without their strategist.

00:18:19.140 --> 00:18:23.170
Yukimura, now is not the time
to feel concerned for our foe.

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:25.260
If the One-Eyed Dragon
should be defeated by Ashina,

00:18:25.350 --> 00:18:27.890
that will be the end of him.

00:18:27.980 --> 00:18:31.390
If he should prevail,
you will surely see him again.

00:18:31.480 --> 00:18:33.270
Yes, Sir!

00:18:36.030 --> 00:18:37.730
Good sirs,

00:18:37.820 --> 00:18:39.690
though I am young and inexperienced,

00:18:39.780 --> 00:18:43.320
I intend to lead this company
to the best of my ability!

00:18:43.410 --> 00:18:47.280
I ask most humbly that you
devote yourselves heart and soul!

00:18:47.370 --> 00:18:49.620
I, Sanada Genjiro Yukimura,

00:18:49.710 --> 00:18:52.200
in the company of the
best of the Takeda cavalry,

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:58.000
embark upon the solitary mission
to aid the brave warriors of Satsuma!

00:19:01.510 --> 00:19:03.130
Lord Masamune,

00:19:03.220 --> 00:19:05.880
I was once defeated by you.

00:19:05.970 --> 00:19:08.010
Therefore, O shall not fear for you now.

00:19:08.100 --> 00:19:12.560
So that I may be a worthy
opponent when we meet again someday,

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:18.730
right now, I have but to give my
all to carrying out my lord's orders!

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:24.730
With all due respect,

00:19:24.830 --> 00:19:28.240
sending out Master Sanada
right now, of all things, is...

00:19:28.330 --> 00:19:30.070
It is because it is now.

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:31.150
What?

00:19:31.250 --> 00:19:34.210
These urgent and perilous times

00:19:34.290 --> 00:19:37.580
present exactly the golden
opportunity to send him on a journey.

00:19:37.670 --> 00:19:41.260
With what countenance will he return?

00:19:41.340 --> 00:19:43.710
It will be something to see.

00:19:45.260 --> 00:19:50.260
Yukimura, though we are apart,
we share the same fate.

00:19:50.350 --> 00:19:53.890
If we never see each other again
in this life, that would be fine, too.

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:55.940
At all times, no matter what may happen,

00:19:56.020 --> 00:19:57.980
always be a man!

00:20:06.530 --> 00:20:09.370
What happened to your hand, Hanbei?

00:20:14.750 --> 00:20:16.250
It's just a scratch.

00:20:16.340 --> 00:20:21.300
It seems you brought back Katakura
Kojuro, the Right Eye of the Dragon.

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:22.710
To what purpose?

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:25.960
He's a valuable asset, so I poached him.

00:20:26.050 --> 00:20:28.170
For the sake of the Toyotomi's future.

00:20:28.260 --> 00:20:30.630
All I need is you.

00:20:30.730 --> 00:20:33.970
Our army will grow even bigger from here on out.

00:20:34.060 --> 00:20:38.050
We'll need more than one excellent strategist.

00:20:38.150 --> 00:20:40.810
I cannot think that he will change allegiances.

00:20:40.900 --> 00:20:43.940
Not while the One-Eyed Dragon is alive, no.

00:20:45.950 --> 00:20:47.730
Right about now,

00:20:47.830 --> 00:20:49.820
he should be utterly exhausted
from fighting on all fronts

00:20:49.910 --> 00:20:52.030
against the neighboring lands.

00:20:53.250 --> 00:20:57.210
Takeda of Kai has been pinned down for now.

00:20:57.290 --> 00:20:58.830
And it should be about time

00:20:58.920 --> 00:21:02.410
the Maeda Army was launching
their invasion against Echigo.

00:21:05.590 --> 00:21:08.260
Maeda will attack from the front

00:21:08.350 --> 00:21:09.210
and having defeated Date,

00:21:09.310 --> 00:21:13.050
Ashina and the other three
armies will strike from the back.

00:21:13.140 --> 00:21:16.510
I'm going to head for Aki now.

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:20.470
We need to finish up
negotiating the alliance with Mori.

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:23.900
Our next target will be Chosokabe of Shikoku.

00:21:23.990 --> 00:21:28.030
We shouldn't need your assistance until then.

00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:29.820
Hanbei.

00:21:29.910 --> 00:21:31.620
What is it, Hideyoshi?

00:21:31.700 --> 00:21:34.030
There is no need for such haste.

00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:36.080
You should rest, too.

00:21:36.170 --> 00:21:37.500
Thank you.

00:21:37.580 --> 00:21:40.450
If I manage to bring down Shikoku, I'll do that.

00:21:42.460 --> 00:21:43.870
Once Shikoku falls,

00:21:43.970 --> 00:21:48.050
you will insist on heading
straight for Satsuma, will you not?

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:49.920
Perhaps so...

00:21:57.810 --> 00:22:00.680
I am merely impatient to see it.

00:22:02.610 --> 00:22:06.770
The sight of this country under your rule...

00:23:42.290 --> 00:23:43.950
If something's important to you,

00:23:44.040 --> 00:23:46.080
you'll defend it to the death.

00:23:46.170 --> 00:23:48.160
The one who taught me that was...

00:23:50.220 --> 00:23:51.750
It'll be hard,

00:23:51.840 --> 00:23:54.960
but make sure you see the next
episode through to the end, too.
